// # Catalog Docs Index — Anchor for Agents
//
// Logline: Index of the user-facing docs for the public catalog.
//
// Setup: RFC-0005. Website Source: openOODA/catalog/docs/.
//        They travel with this repo.
//
// Beats:
//   1. catalog.oot — name|version|caps|deps|sha lines.
